WEBVTT

04:20.625 --> 04:22.042
You…
Answer me!

04:22.209 --> 04:24.000
Hey, mind your language!

04:24.292 --> 04:25.709
You went to jail and
you're still as barbaric.

04:25.792 --> 04:26.834
-Yes, I am!
-Hey!

04:26.959 --> 04:29.625
What's with this drama every day?
We're not able to sleep.

04:29.750 --> 04:31.625
She sent my wife and daughter away.
